		<ol outputclass="callout" id="e00633">
			<li>
				<p>Day</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>Night</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<p>Make this adjustment before you start driving and while the day/night lever is in the day position (1).</p>
		<p>Pull the day/night lever toward you (2) to reduce the glare from the headlamps of the vehicles behind you when night driving.</p>
		<p>Remember that you lose some rearview clarity in the night position.</p>
